      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With the new patch in the works that considers disabled game objects for performance, this would be a huge boon.  https://medium.com/@vrchat/avatar-performance-stats-and-rank-blocking-1ae0feddc775\n\nI have a few components that nobody else needs to see that will soon be a heavy performance ranking hit even though they're only ever active like 0.1% of the time (when toggled on).   These could be marked local only and excluded from performance calculations since it's only affecting the wearer.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
