      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are plenty of other practical uses for this than just cameras, such as having a flashlight only I can see or a shader HUD that only I can see.\n\nThis would potentially save people on avatar performance rankings in various ways, and thus make creation feel less restrictive and encourage us to do more with our designs.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
